<title>USA: Hussey copper price drops to 131 cents a lb.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price drops to 131 cents a lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price declined one cent to 131.00 cents a lb, effective with March 7 shipments.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
